sentences.l:
“Be now the Sun witness, and this Earth, to me calling,
for whose sake such great toils I have had strength to endure,
and the almighty father, and you, Saturnian consort,
now kinder, now, goddess, I pray, and you, renowned Mavors,
who all wars, father, beneath your sway turn;

sentences.t:
“Haec eadem, Aenea, terram mare sidera iuro
Latonaeque genus duplex Ianumque bifrontem
vimque deum infernam et duri sacraria Ditis;

sentences.l:
“These same things, Aeneas, by earth, sea, stars I swear,
and Latona's twofold offspring and two-fronted Janus,
and the power of the gods below and of harsh Dis the shrines;

sentences.t:
nec me vis ulla volentem
avertet, non, si tellurem effundat in undas
diluvio miscens caelumque in Tartara solvat;

sentences.l:
nor me any force, willing,
shall turn aside, not if it pour the earth into the waves,
mingling them in flood, and melt heaven into Tartarus;
